        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hulilanga omuruchi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi, Kholanga akelilako liomuruchi, kata khulwa eshiitsubo shiaNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oratetekhana okhurula imbeliwe, kata oratsiililila mwikhuwa libii ta; okhuba akholanga aka yeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila likhuwa liomuruchi neliobunyali; ali heena owakhamureeba mbu Okhola shiina? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oukhola akelilako shialalola libii liosi ta; ne omwoyo kwomuchesi kwahukhasinjia eshise nende injila yobukholi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tsinjila lsiaNyasaye tsishila obumanyi bwabandu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba buli likhuwa lili neshise shialio, nende injila yalio; shichila amasila komundu kamusitohela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba shiamanyanga akeetsa okhubaho ta; ne ali heena owakhanyala okhumuboolela shinga olwa kaliba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulaho ouli nobunyali khuroho, okhwikalila iroho; kata omundu shialikhwo noburuchi khukeinyanga yokhufwa ta; mwihe obuseebulwi bubulaho; kata obubii shibulalekhuula oyo owahaanwa khubwo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano kosi ndakalola, nirakhwo omwoyo khubuli shikhole eshikholwa hasi weliuba, olwa omundu mulala yaamihanga khuwashie, namukhupia khushibii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi ndalola ababii nibayabilwa; abalinji nibeenjila habundu ahatakatifu nibarulaho, nibeetsoomibwa mwitaala omwa bali nibakholeIanga bario. Ako nako namakhaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne okhuba eshiina eshikhalachilwa eshikhole eshibii shishimalanga shiusibwe bwangu ta, abaana babandu batsaalikhanga muno okhukhola obubii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kata olwa omwonooni akhola obubii akhandi eshikhumi, tsindaalotsie nitsimeetekhanga, emanyile tieeli mbu amalayi kalabeetsangaho khubeenabo abariitsanga Nyasaye, shichila bamuriitsanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habula mbu amalayi shikalabeetsangaho khumubii, kata tsindaalotsie shitsilameetekha shinga eshiiniini ta; okhuba shiamuriitsanga Nyasaye tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liliho likhuwa likhaya eliikholanga mushialo; mbu baliho abalunjishi aba amakhuwa kakwilanga akakhoyeele ebikhole biababii; khandi baliho ababii aba amakhuwa kakwilanga akakhoyeele ebikhole biabalunjishi; nisunga mbu ako nako namakhaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho enjamanga emienya; shichila omundu shiaba nelilayi hasi welikulu elishila lino, mbu okhulia nokhunywa nokhutsatsahala, okhuba ako kalabeetsanga ninaye mubunyakhanibwe tsindaalo tsiosi tsiobulamubwe etsia Nyasaye yamuheelesia hasi weliuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa ndarakhwo omwoyo okhumanya akobuchesi, nokhulola okhutiika khwosi okhubeetsangaho khushialo, okhuba baliho aba tsimoni tsiabwe tsirakonangakhwo tsindoolo ta, eshiteere kata eshilo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nolwa ndalola ebikhole biosi biaNyasaye, mbu omundu shianyala okhunoonelesia ebikhole biosi ebikholungwa hasi weliuba ta; shichila kata omundu nanyakhana arie okhukhaaba, shialanyoola ta; ne kata olwa omundu omuchesi akaala mbu wabimanya, shianyala okhunyoolakhwo tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
